# Provisioning-only SSH (ADR-048 DEC-5.1 - DEC-5.5).
#
# dropbear runs only while suderra-provision-mode.service holds the
# provisioning window open (dropbear.service.d/10-suderra-provisioning.conf).
# Root logins are refused (-w), forwarding is off (-j -k), each connection
# gets one password attempt (-T 1; every failed attempt also renews the
# one-time password), and the only host key is the ed25519 key on /data
# whose fingerprint the console shows next to the one-time password.
DROPBEAR_ARGS="-w -j -k -T 1 -I 600 -K 60 -r /etc/dropbear/dropbear_ed25519_host_key"
